<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="_Toc238560321" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 3: No H1 present</title>
   <shortdesc>Consider an index .md file in a folder named Kubernetes_user_doc.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>index</keyword>
        <keyword>present</keyword>
        <keyword>kubernetes</keyword>
        <keyword>Scenario</keyword>
        <keyword>title</keyword>
        <keyword>converter</keyword>
        <indexterm>index</indexterm>
        <indexterm>present</indexterm>
        <indexterm>kubernetes</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname></prodname>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <refbody><section><p>Consider an index .md file in a folder named Kubernetes_user_doc. This file has no title metadata and no H1 (<codeph>#</codeph>). In this case, the converter generates the following DITA bookmap structure:</p>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>No H1 is present</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry> .md input </entry>
                     <entry> DITA output </entry>
                  </row>
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>Folder: kubernetes_user_doc
  Filename: index.md</codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>&lt;map id="kubernetes_user_doc"&gt;
  &lt;title&gt;index&lt;/title&gt;
  &lt;/map&gt;
  OR
  &lt;bookmap id="kubernetes_user_doc"&gt;
  &lt;booktitle&gt;
  &lt;mainbooktitle&gt;index&lt;/mainbooktitle&gt;
  &lt;/booktitle&gt;
  &lt;/bookmap&gt;</codeblock>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
<p>
            <b>Result:</b> The converter falls back on the filename for the root map title.</p></section></refbody>
</reference>
